L88: Figure 3 Calculated rates of oxidation of endogenous CHO ( A , B ), exogenous CHO ( C , D ) total CHO ( E , F ) and total fat ( G , H ) during a 26 km race walking protocol for elite male race walkers following moderate CHO availability (CON;  n  = 10;  A , C , E , G ) or high CHO availability (MAX;  n  = 9;  B , D , F , H ) intervention. * Significant within group difference between Trial A and B.  #  Significant within group difference between Trials B and C. Note that attention has been limited to interaction effects, and in the case of exogenous CHO (and endogenous CHO, calculated by difference from total CHO), only values from 13–26 km have been included in the statistical analysis.
