L168: Acknowledgments
L169: We acknowledge the resources and personnel support from the Australian Institute of Sport in the conduct of this study; particularly the AIS residence and food services teams, and members of the Disciplines of Sports Nutrition and Physiology. We thank Asker Jeukendrup for guidance in establishing the  13 C-glucose technique. Most of all we acknowledge the generosity and camaraderie of the Supernova race walking family who provide their blood, sweat and tears towards scientific activities.
